?? what is dependency??
“Dependency means a relationship where one class or component depends on another class or component to perform its work. For example, if a UserController needs UserService, then UserController has a dependency on UserService. In Spring Boot, dependencies are usually managed by the Spring container using Dependency Injection.”
@Service
class UserService {
}

@RestController
class UserController {

    @Autowired
    UserService userService;
}

>>>>>>UserController → depends on → UserService
